00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:42,000
But when we think about attention, we can immediately look at this picture and pick out

604
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:44,840
the important parts.

605
00:43:44,840 --> 00:43:50,760
One naive way to do this would be to scan the data, pixel by pixel, go across it.

