00:43:50,760 --> 00:43:55,320
But all of us intuitively, we maybe don't necessarily do this.

607
00:43:55,320 --> 00:44:01,200
We don't eyeball left or right, we can immediately pick out the important parts.

608
00:44:01,200 --> 00:44:08,040
And so the core idea behind this is if we want to identify which parts to attend to, that's

609
00:44:08,040 --> 00:44:09,360
step one.

610
00:44:09,360 --> 00:44:16,080
And then we use that identification to extract the features or the actual content of the input

611
00:44:16,080 --> 00:44:20,560
that have high attention scores or high attention values.

612
00:44:20,560 --> 00:44:25,940
And it's really this first part of the problem that's the core, which is very similar to this

