00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:23,840
So breaking this down, let's say we have this input sentence, he tossed the tennis ball

650
00:47:23,840 --> 00:47:25,600
to serve.

651
00:47:25,600 --> 00:47:31,800
First, we want to eliminate recurrence, but preserve information about order.

652
00:47:31,800 --> 00:47:37,720
If we're going to feed the data in all at once, we still want a way to encode or represent

