00:48:24,800 --> 00:48:29,240
And there are the fundamental components of the attention mechanism.

663
00:48:29,240 --> 00:48:34,040
And so we're going to take that position embedding, which is representing our sequence input

664
00:48:34,040 --> 00:48:35,760
all at once.

665
00:48:35,760 --> 00:48:41,040
And in this case, in this example, we're going to look at self-attention, meaning in

